# tally 2.2 (CHANGES.md 2.2-9), L §5.14.1: `low` is cut; a lowest balance is a `min` over days,
# `min(bal(x, d) from t for d in a .. b step 1 day)`. `low(…)` reads on as an item at its keys and stops at the span.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2025-01-01..

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2025-01-01
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask q: low(konto, 2026-01-01 .. 2026-01-31) from 2026-01-01
=== expect
refused: LOAD-PARSE cannot parse: expected ")", got .. (m.tally:17)
